

 This is how each main object in the database must be.



 Models:


 Model of object users:

   properties of object:

     id         -> numeric
     created_at -> string
     updated_at -> string
     name       -> string
     email      -> string
     password   -> string



 Model of object messages:

   properties of object:

     id                -> numeric
     created_at        -> string
     updated_at        -> string
     user_id           -> numeric
     recipient_user_id -> numeric
     content           -> string
     read_at           -> string
     status            -> string ("sent", "delivered", "read")


 Model of object groups:

   properties of object:

     id              -> numeric
     created_at      -> string
     updated_at      -> string
     name            -> string
     participant_ids -> number[]
     admin_ids       -> number[]



 Model of object login:

   properties of object:

     id         -> numeric
     created_at -> string
     updated_at -> string
     user_id    -> numeric
     is_logged  -> boolean
